# Practice (a 3-player table): the hint, a tile selected by the arrows and
# played on its end (A/D or Enter), Undo, the top view, the Table drawer,
# Pause and its Settings and back, Leave, Continue Match from the title, then
# a speed challenge with its clock.
until 300 Chain Dominoes
frames 20
click Practice
until 60 Take a seat
frames 10
click 2 players
frames 10
click 3 players
frames 10
save practice-setup
click Take a seat
until 400 Your turn
frames 30
key KeyH 2
frames 20
save hint
key ArrowRight 2
frames 10
key ArrowRight 2
frames 10
save arrows
click Top view
frames 30
save top-view
click Toggle table panel
until 60 Open ends
frames 10
save drawer
click Close
frames 10
key KeyP 2
until 60 Paused
frames 10
click Settings
until 60 Keyboard & gamepad
frames 10
key Escape 2
until 60 Resume
frames 10
click Resume
frames 10
key KeyP 2
until 60 Leave match
frames 10
click Leave match
until 60 Continue Match
frames 10
save title-continue
click Continue Match
until 200 YOUR HAND
frames 30
save continued
key KeyP 2
until 60 Leave match
frames 10
click Leave match
until 60 Challenges
frames 10
click Challenges
